        data-bitcoin="true"
        data-alipay="true"
        data-ideal="true"
        data-session-id="{{ $sessionId }}"
    >
    </script>
</form>
```

7. Create success and cancel routes and views:

Create new routes and views for successful and cancelled payments. For example:

